# Command: Development Backend API

## Purpose

Start the NestJS API in watch mode.

## Prerequisites

- Node.js **24.16.0** (`nvm use` at repo root)
- `api/.env` configured (copy from `api/.env.example`)
- Database reachable; migrations applied (`npm run db:setup`)

## Execution

```bash
nvm use
cd api && npm run start:dev
```

| Resource | URL |
| -------- | --- |
| API base | `http://localhost:3000/api` |
| Swagger | `http://localhost:3000/api/docs` |
| Health | `http://localhost:3000/api/health` |

